# MogaFace does not require any environment variables yet.
#
# The current facial-analysis pipeline (Phases 1-21) runs entirely in the
# browser: no server-side API keys, database, or third-party service is
# involved. This file exists as a placeholder for future phases —
# see ARCHITECTURE.md ("Future layers") for what each variable below will do
# once implemented. Do not add real secrets to this file; copy it to
# .env.local (already gitignored) and fill in real values there instead.

# --- Future: AI report generation (server-side only) ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=

# --- Future: auth, user accounts, stored assessments ---
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
